git status: git status is used to find the status of file in the git repository. it will show the untracted, modified and staged files.

Modified file : u changed an already tracked file, but latest changes are not staged 
untracked files : u created a new files that git not track yet
staged files: those files are added into staging area,these are ready to commit 

