git add . and git add <filename>:
stages changes from working directory,so they can include in next commit

git commit : save the staged changes as a commit in git local repo
git push → Uploads local commits to the remote repository, such as GitHub.

Remember: add → Stage, commit → Save locally, push → Upload remotely.


